.* Error cases, one per line where possible.
.IM NOSUCHMBR
.CE a control word the compiler does not have
:PNLGRP BOGUS=1.
stray text in the group
:CLASS NAME=C1 BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=C1 BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NOWIDTH BASETYPE=DEC.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=BADTYPE BASETYPE='BLOB 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TOOLONGNAME BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OPENTL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:TL.
:TI VALUE=1.one
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=V1 CLASS=C1.
:VAR NAME=V2 CLASS=NOCLASS.
:VAR NAME=V3 CLASS=NOWIDTH.
:VAR NAME=V1 CLASS=C1.
:VAR NAME=V4.
:LISTDEF NAME=L1 VARS='V1 V2 NOVAR'.
:COND NAME=BAD EXPR='&V1. EQ'.
:COND NAME=OK EXPR='&V1. EQ &NOVAR2.'.
:TT NAME=T1 CONDS='OK NOCOND'.
:TTROW VALUES='1 0 1'.
:TTROW VALUES='1 Q'.
:ETT.
:KEYL NAME=K1.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=CANCEL.F3=Again
:KEYI KEY=F99 ACTION=EXIT.
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION=JUMP.
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='PANEL NOPANEL'.
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION=EXIT COND=NOCOND HELP=NOHELP.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=P1 KEYL=NOKEYL HELP=NOHELP DEPTH=25 WIDTH=80.Errors
:DATA DEPTH=30 LAYOUT=5.
:DATAI VAR=V3 USAGE=INPUT.No width
:DATAI VAR=V1 USAGE=SIDEWAYS.Bad usage
:DATAI VAR=V1.No usage
:DATAIXT.Extender text with no field
:DATACOL.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH=4 LISTDEF=NOLIST VIEWS=3.
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Again
:LISTACT OPTION=ABC ENTER='RETURN 3'.
:LISTACT HELP=NOHELP.
:LISTVIEW COLS='NOCOL'.
:ELIST.
:LIST DEPTH=4 LISTDEF=L1.
:ELIST.
:MENU DEPTH=4.
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION=EXIT.One
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION=EXIT.One again
:MENUI OPTION=100 ACTION=EXIT.Too big
:MENUI OPTION=0 ACTION=EXIT.Zero
:MENUI OPTION='*' ACTION=CMDLINE.Star without a command line
:EMENU.
:P.A paragraph where no paragraph goes
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=P2 KEYL=K1.Two command lines
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Command
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Command again
:MENU DEPTH=4 OPTIONS=V1.
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 1'.One
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=P3 KEYL=K1.Nothing in it
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=H1.Empty help
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=H2.Open highlight
:P.Text with :HP2.an open highlight
:P.And an unknown &NOSYMBOL. symbol
:XMP.unterminated example
:EHELP.
:NOSUCHTAG.
:EPANEL.
:EPNLGRP.
:PNLGRP.
